00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:20.791
 Now let's get back to Kinosaki.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.708
It's going to end with us walking back.

00:08:24.625 --> 00:08:26.333
Then we can take a hot bath.

00:08:27.291 --> 00:08:27.958
Right, right.

00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:31.875
We just finished dinner and
decided to jump in

00:08:31.958 --> 00:08:36.083
our fully Japanese yukata attire
and decided to

00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:38.458
head out for a little bit of
a sanpo, a little bit

00:08:38.541 --> 00:08:41.125
of a walk through Kinosaki town.

00:08:41.541 --> 00:08:43.500
Maybe check out some onsens.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.750
There's some public onsens.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.458
I believe there's like five,

00:08:46.541 --> 00:08:47.708
Five? Isn't it five?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:48.666
How many?

00:08:48.791 --> 00:08:49.541
Seven.

00:08:49.708 --> 00:08:51.208
Lisa confirms there's seven.

00:08:51.208 --> 00:08:53.458
At least according to 
the map we have here.

00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:55.875
So there's seven public onsens 
that you can go to

00:08:56.041 --> 00:08:58.833
and if you stay at 
one of the hotels here at Kinosaki

00:08:59.125 --> 00:09:01.041
they're going to provide you with a pass

00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:02.750
that allows you to go visit every

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:06.000
one of them if you want to.
I would say that it's

00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:08.833
a little bit overkill, but you
can if you want to.

00:09:08.916 --> 00:09:11.750
We're also very much as interested
in going into the town

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.666
and see how the ambience is 
and everything like that. 

00:09:14.666 --> 00:09:15.750
We're on
the shuttle bus right now

00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:17.791
that's going to take us to the town. 

00:09:22.041 --> 00:09:25.625
When night falls, 
Kinosaki really comes alive.

00:09:28.125 --> 00:09:32.666
The streets are softly lit by warm street
lamps and the sound of wooden sandals

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:37.041
echoes through the town as people walk
between the public bath houses.

00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:45.916
Even if you're not planning
to visit a bath house,

00:09:46.458 --> 00:09:51.208
it's worth wandering the streets 
and taking in the atmosphere of the town.

00:10:15.958 --> 00:10:20.291
And we are at the second onsen spot.
I think this is the final

00:10:21.208 --> 00:10:23.750
onsens spot for us for the night, 
before we head

00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:25.791
back to our hotel and for a
good night's sleep.

00:10:52.833 --> 00:10:54.416
All right, so early morning right now,

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.250
we are now about to check out
of our hotel here

00:10:57.333 --> 00:10:59.041
at Kinosaki Onsen.

00:10:59.125 --> 00:11:00.416
It's been a pleasure staying here.

00:11:00.625 --> 00:11:02.416
The private onsen was incredible.

00:11:02.916 --> 00:11:04.666
I would definitely recommend
if you're in Kyoto

00:11:04.666 --> 00:11:07.166
and you want to have an onsen
town experience,

00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:08.750
go visit Kinosaki Onsen.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:09.666
It's a great place.

00:11:10.208 --> 00:11:13.208
A lot of different hotels and
ryokans up here

00:11:13.583 --> 00:11:15.083
that you can check out.

00:11:15.291 --> 00:11:17.458
And also the cool thing about
these seven different

00:11:17.625 --> 00:11:18.750
public baths that you can visit

00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:20.125
if you're into that as well.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:25.750
After checking out, we make one last stop
and visit the Kinosaki Ropeway.

00:11:49.291 --> 00:11:53.208
We just arrived at the top
of Kinosaki Ropeway.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:57.833
We are on the top station or top
of the mountain basically.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.750
And there's like a little
coffee shop here.

00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:01.166
There's a little viewing platform.

00:12:01.625 --> 00:12:02.541
There's not a lot to do,

00:12:02.625 --> 00:12:07.375
but you do get like a nice view
of Kinosaki onsen below.

00:12:07.666 --> 00:12:10.291
It's rainy right now, as you
probably can see.

00:12:10.375 --> 00:12:12.833
So the visibility is pretty
low right now.

00:12:13.166 --> 00:12:15.875
A lot of clouds, a lot of
fog, but you know,

00:12:15.958 --> 00:12:17.916
still trying to enjoy our time here,

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.791
our last few hours here in Kinosaki

00:12:19.875 --> 00:12:21.166
before we head to Kyoto.

00:12:22.625 --> 00:12:25.125
So right now just getting some footage

00:12:25.375 --> 00:12:26.458
and then we're heading into the cafe

00:12:26.708 --> 00:12:28.500
for a quick coffee break.

00:12:29.333 --> 00:12:31.000
And then down to the town,

00:12:31.083 --> 00:12:32.708
taking the train to Kyoto, 

00:12:32.708 --> 00:12:34.166
sucks with the weather,

00:12:34.333 --> 00:12:36.125
but still trying to make
the most out of it.

00:12:47.166 --> 00:12:48.666
Back down in town,

00:12:48.958 --> 00:12:50.791
we make our way to Kinosaki station.

00:12:52.083 --> 00:12:54.708
But before that, we stop
for Onsen Tamago,

00:12:55.333 --> 00:12:58.750
eggs, gently boiled using 
natural hot spring water.

00:13:43.416 --> 00:13:45.375
We also managed to pick
up one last snack,

00:13:45.916 --> 00:13:47.083
a Tajima Beef bun.

00:14:13.416 --> 00:14:17.958
All right, that was my trip
to Kinosaki onsen.

00:14:18.375 --> 00:14:21.916
I really enjoyed my visit to this
small hot spring town.

00:14:22.333 --> 00:14:26.375
And if you're looking for a proper
onsen town experience,

00:14:26.541 --> 00:14:30.166
that's near Kyoto, definitely
consider Kinosaki onsen.

00:14:30.625 --> 00:14:32.250
The food and the private onsen

00:14:32.333 --> 00:14:34.625
were the definite highlights
of this trip.

00:14:35.291 --> 00:14:38.000
And I highly recommend doing
at the very least

00:14:38.083 --> 00:14:40.541
an overnight trip 
rather than a day trip.

00:14:40.875 --> 00:14:42.250
You're simply not gonna 
have enough time

00:14:42.416 --> 00:14:44.500
to immerse yourself in the town.

00:14:45.291 --> 00:14:46.833
So yeah, that's it for me.

00:14:47.125 --> 00:14:49.041
Thank you for watching this video.

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:53.416
For more Japan videos, 
stay tuned on this channel.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:54.816
This is Allan,

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.000
safe travels,

00:14:56.208 --> 00:14:58.000
and I'll see you guys 
very soon.

